        },
        {
          "text": "Haali kavaga ku muhiga, Solomoni yahaana vihaanwa viu kusambwa kandi vihaanwa vie mirembe ku vwali vwa yaali ni yumbakiyi Yahova. Yasambira Yahova vimuli. Nindio, lwa yamala kwumbaka Litembeli.",
          "type": "text",
